~ start

Guide: You've done well so far.

Guide: It's time to grow something even more valuable.

do SeedUnlockManager.unlock_seed("tomato_seeds")

Guide: Tomato Seeds are now available at the Seed Shop.

Guide: Buy some Tomato Seeds, harvest 5 Tomatoes, and bring them to me.

=> END


~ progress

Guide: Tomatoes are worth more than Corn.

Guide: A good farmer always looks for better opportunities.

Guide: Bring me 5 Tomatoes when they're ready.

=> END


~ turn_in

Guide: Excellent work!

Guide: Your farm is becoming more productive.

do QuestManager.try_complete_quest()

Guide: Tomatoes can be sold for a good price.

Guide: Keep farming, keep selling, and keep saving your Gold.

Guide: We'll need both money and materials to rebuild Harvestia.

Guide: Your next task is to collect 20 Logs from the forest.

do QuestManager.start_quest("rebuilding_harvestia")

Guide: Return to me after you've gathered enough Logs.

=> END

~ completed

Guide: Good luck.

=> END